{"version":6,"ocItems":{"Ace in the Hole":{"Imitator":1381},"Manifest Cruelty":{"Hacker":73,"Interrogator":1223,"Reviver":884,"Cat Burglar":1429},"Blast from the Past":{"Hacker":103,"Engineer":1431,"Bomber":1430,"Muscle":1429},"Counter Offer":{"Robber":1429,"Looter":1429,"Hacker":70,"Picklock":1203,"Engineer":981},"Stage Fright":{"Lookout":1258},"Crane Reaction":{"Lookout":1258,"Engineer":1430,"Bomber":1230,"Muscle #2":256},"Leave No Trace":{"Negotiator":1350,"Imitator":1350},"Gaslight the Way":{"Imitator #1":643,"Imitator #2":1381,"Imitator #3":1381},"Break the Bank":{"Robber":1331,"Muscle #1":1331,"Muscle #2":1429,"Muscle #3":1331,"Thief #1":1331,"Thief #2":1331},"Clinical Precision":{"Imitator":1094,"Assassin":576,"Cleaner":1012},"Sneaky Git Grab":{"Hacker":71,"Techie":579},"Plucking the Lotus Petal":{"Hustler":327},"Bidding War":{"Robber #1":568,"Robber #2":222,"Robber #3":1284,"Bomber #1":190,"Bomber #2":190},"Market Forces":{"Arsonist":172},"Window of Opportunity":{"Engineer":981,"Looter #1":980,"Looter #2":1509,"Muscle #1":1259,"Muscle #2":1277},"Dish It Out":{"Assassin":1363,"Muscle":159,"Saboteur #1":1461,"Saboteur #2":1461,"Engineer":981},"Stacking the Deck":{"Cat Burglar":568,"Driver":226,"Hacker":73,"Imitator":1381},"Snow Blind":{"Imitator":201},"Gone Fission":{"Hijacker":1429,"Engineer":1461,"Pickpocket":567,"Imitator":1383,"Bomber":190},"No Reserve":{"Car Thief":159,"Techie":856,"Engineer":576},"Honey Trap":{"Enforcer":1080,"Muscle #2":1080},"Guardian Ángels":{"Engineer":1331}},"aboutHtml":"\n      <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 4px\">Torn OC Best-Fit</h2>\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><i>Picks your best Organized Crime role and keeps your faction's crimes succeeding.</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:12px\">by <a href=\"https://www.torn.com/profiles.php?XID=2805199\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#58a6ff\">KamiRen [2805199]</a></p>\n      <h3 style=\"margin:12px 0 4px\">What you get</h3>\n      <ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 18px;padding:0;line-height:1.7\">\n        <li><b>Best role, instantly</b> - the single best open OC slot for you to join right now.</li>\n        <li><b>Real success odds</b> - every slot shows your true chance of the crime succeeding, color-coded.</li>\n        <li><b>A standing score</b> - rises when you win and play for the faction, fades old mistakes over time.</li>\n        <li><b>Smart gating</b> - if your score drops too low, the hardest crimes lock until you recover.</li>\n        <li><b>Clear requirements</b> - shows what each slot needs and greys out Join if you don't meet it.</li>\n        <li><b>Growth trend</b> - tracks how your pass rate improves as you train.</li>\n        <li><b>Faction-tunable</b> - leaders set the scoring rules; everyone else just benefits.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 4px\">What to expect</h3>\n      <ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 18px;padding:0;line-height:1.7\">\n        <li>Each member runs it with their own Torn API key and sees their own best fit.</li>\n        <li>The score and trends fill in over time - more useful the longer you use it.</li>\n        <li>It nudges everyone toward crimes they can actually finish, lifting the whole faction.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 4px\">Your privacy &amp; data</h3>\n      <ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 18px;padding:0;line-height:1.7\">\n        <li>Your API key is never stored - sent only to verify you with Torn, then discarded.</li>\n        <li>All shared data goes through a locked gateway that proves your identity - no spoofing, no peeking at other factions.</li>\n        <li>Your battle stats stay on your device, encrypted, and are never uploaded.</li>\n        <li>Only your own pass rates and picks are shared - and only while you leave “Share my CPR” on.</li>\n        <li>Flip that switch off anytime to stop sharing; already-uploaded data can be wiped on request.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--ocbf-border, var(--default-panel-divider-color, rgba(255,255,255,.08)));margin:14px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px\"><b>How the numbers work</b> - every figure (CPR, faction rate, blended score, expected money) is explained in the <b>Help</b> tab.</p><h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 4px\">Sources</h3>\n      <ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 18px\">\n        <li>Torn API v2: <code>/user/organizedcrimes</code>, <code>/faction/crimes</code></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://wiki.torn.com/wiki/Organized_Crime_2.0\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#58a6ff\">Torn Wiki - Organized Crime 2.0</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.torn.com/forums.php?p=threads&f=61&t=16469633\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#58a6ff\">Forum guide - OC 2.0 Crime Role Success Influence</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.torn.com/forums.php?p=threads&f=2&t=16494528\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#58a6ff\">Forum - OC 2.0 Role Scaling Info &amp; Discussion</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.torn.com/forums.php?p=threads&f=61&t=16438960\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#58a6ff\">Forum - Anatomy of an Organized Crime (CPR is per-crime, not just per-role)</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <div style=\"text-align:right;margin-top:14px\"><button id=\"ocbf-about-close\" style=\"background:#21262d;color:#c9d1d9;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 14px;cursor:pointer\">Close</button></div>","helpHtml":"<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:13px 0 5px\"><span style=\"width:3px;height:13px;background:#d4a017;border-radius:2px;flex:0 0 auto\"></span><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4);font-size:12.5px\">Success colors</b></div><div style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);margin:0 0 5px\">Slot score = your CPR × how often faction finishes that crime.</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;margin:3px 0 6px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #3fb950;color:#3fb950;font-weight:700;font-size:11px\">green ≥70</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #d4a017;color:#d4a017;font-weight:700;font-size:11px\">yellow 50-69</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #e5534b;color:#e5534b;font-weight:700;font-size:11px\">red &lt;50</span></div><div style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);margin:0 0 5px\"><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4)\">~</b> = community estimate (thin faction history).</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:13px 0 5px\"><span style=\"width:3px;height:13px;background:#d4a017;border-radius:2px;flex:0 0 auto\"></span><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4);font-size:12.5px\">Slot tags</b></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background:var(--ocbf-ctl-bg);border:1px solid var(--ocbf-border);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;color:var(--ocbf-ctl-text);font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap\">94 (Req 70)</span> left = your score / min to join.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background:var(--ocbf-ctl-bg);border:1px solid var(--ocbf-border);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;color:var(--ocbf-ctl-text);font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap\">+8 / -11</span> right = standing move on win / fail.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background:var(--ocbf-ctl-bg);border:1px solid var(--ocbf-border);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;color:var(--ocbf-ctl-text);font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap\">Score 960</span> right = standing still needed for that difficulty.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:13px 0 5px\"><span style=\"width:3px;height:13px;background:#d4a017;border-radius:2px;flex:0 0 auto\"></span><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4);font-size:12.5px\">Join rules</b></div><div style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);margin:0 0 5px\">Join needs <b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4)\">both</b>:</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:#3fb950;flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\">score ≥ <b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4)\">Req</b>.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:#3fb950;flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\">standing ≥ that difficulty’s score.</span></div><div style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);margin:0 0 5px\">Else Join disabled.</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:13px 0 5px\"><span style=\"width:3px;height:13px;background:#d4a017;border-radius:2px;flex:0 0 auto\"></span><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4);font-size:12.5px\">Standing (Score tab)</b></div><div style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);margin:0 0 5px\">Start <b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4)\">1000</b>. Moves with play:</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:#3fb950;flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><b style=\"color:#3fb950\">+</b> wins, crit roles, following recs, faction presets.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:#e5534b;flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><b style=\"color:#e5534b\">−</b> fails, weak crit play.</span></div><div style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);margin:0 0 5px\">Recent weighs most, old fades. Higher standing unlocks harder OCs.</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:13px 0 5px\"><span style=\"width:3px;height:13px;background:#d4a017;border-radius:2px;flex:0 0 auto\"></span><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4);font-size:12.5px\">0% crime</b></div><div style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);margin:0 0 5px\">Empty OC (no members) = 0%.</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:13px 0 5px\"><span style=\"width:3px;height:13px;background:#d4a017;border-radius:2px;flex:0 0 auto\"></span><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4);font-size:12.5px\">How numbers computed</b></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4)\">Raw CPR</b> - your <code>checkpoint_pass_rate</code> from <code>/v2/user/organizedcrimes</code>. Read, not modeled.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4)\">Faction rate</b> - <code>ok/(ok+fail)</code> per crime from <code>/v2/faction/crimes</code> (cached weekly).</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4)\">Community</b> - thin history blends to baseline <code>p&#770;=(wins+K·p_global)/(attempts+K)</code>. Shown at ≥3 factions, crime-level only. Marked <b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4)\">~</b>.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4)\">Blended</b> = <code>rawCPR × factionRate</code> → drives the colors.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;margin:0 0 4px\"><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700\">•</span><span style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6)\"><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4)\">Money</b> = median crime money × payout% ÷ participants (your cut). Respect = crime-level.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin:13px 0 5px\"><span style=\"width:3px;height:13px;background:#d4a017;border-radius:2px;flex:0 0 auto\"></span><b style=\"color:var(--default-color, #d4d4d4);font-size:12.5px\">Limits</b></div><div style=\"color:var(--ocbf-sub, #9aa0a6);margin:0 0 5px\">CPR needs your own key. Reward tables go stale if Torn rebalances crimes.</div>"}